title: "Proof of Human Intent (PoHI)"

abstract: >
  Proof of Human Intent (PoHI) is a privacy-preserving research protocol
  for verifying human intent in AI-mediated digital transactions using
  behavioral biometrics and Zero-Knowledge Proofs (zk-SNARKs).

